sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as cli/jobs.ts (jobs sync)
    participant T as jobs.toml
    participant H as cli-handler.ts
    participant C as jobs-clock.ts
    participant L as launchd (legacy entries)

    CLI->>T: read + parseJobsConfig
    alt invalid or missing
        CLI-->>CLI: error, exit 1 (the daemon is never asked)
    else no socket / refused
        CLI-->>CLI: daemon not running, it will load this on start + job lines, exit 0
    else daemon up
        CLI->>H: jobs-sync
        H->>C: requestSync()
        C->>C: before = last good config (_daemon.json)
        C->>T: read + parse, lastGoodConfig = text
        C->>L: remove this platform's legacy entries (live state dir only)
        C->>C: tick now: an owed slot dispatches at once
        C-->>H: {before, after, legacyRemoved}
        H-->>CLI: reply
        CLI-->>CLI: added / changed (jobs.toml keys) / removed, legacy removed, job lines, exit 0
    end
